e:"Local video model",localH3Summary:"Local install runs open-weight MiniMax H3-Base only: 768p short edge, 24 fps, with stereo audio. Official 2K and prompt enhancement stay on the cloud API.",localH3SetsIntro:"The open weights come in two sets. Download either set, or both. The first set is text, first frame, and last frame. The second set is reference images, video, and audio. Each set is about 135GB. Two GPUs can run one set at a time. Running both follows the last table.",localH3SetFl2va:"Text and frames",localH3SetRef2va:"References",localH3SetBoth:"Download both",localH3SetFl2vaTitle:"Computer for text and frames",localH3SetRef2vaTitle:"Computer for reference images, video, and audio",localH3SetBothTitle:"Computer for both sets",localH3SetSameNote:"This set is the same size as the text set, so the computer requirements match.",localH3BothSystemRec:"Windows or Linux. macOS cannot host it",localH3BothGpuMin:"Four high-memory NVIDIA GPUs. Two GPUs can run only one set",localH3BothGpuRec:"Eight data-center GPUs",localH3BothRamMin:"About 384GB",localH3BothRamRec:"About 384GB",localH3BothDiskMin:"About 300GB free",localH3BothDiskRec:"More than 300GB free. The two sets together are about 270GB",localH3CompareTitle:"Open weights and API",localH3ColItem:"Item",localH3ColOpen:"Local open weights",localH3ColApi:"Cloud API",localH3CmpModel:"Model",localH3CmpModelOpen:"H3-Base",localH3CmpModelApi:"H3 / H3-Max, including the full pipeline",localH3CmpPicture:"Picture",localH3CmpPictureOpen:"768p short edge, 24 fps",localH3CmpPictureApi:"Official 2K is available",localH3CmpSound:"Sound",localH3CmpSoundOpen:"Stereo",localH3CmpSoundApi:"The finished clip includes audio",localH3CmpEnhance:"Prompt enhancement",localH3CmpEnhanceOpen:"No",localH3CmpEnhanceApi:"Yes",localH3CmpCost:"Cost",localH3CmpCostOpen:"Video generation does not spend canvas tokens; it uses your GPUs",localH3CmpCostApi:"Billed by the API",localH3CmpMachine:"Computer",localH3CmpMachineOpen:"Windows or Linux, at least two ~24GB GPUs, about 200GB of system memory",localH3CmpMachineApi:"No local GPU required",localH3CmpSetup:"Setup",localH3CmpSetupOpen:"Download about 135GB of text and first/last-frame weights",localH3CmpSetupApi:"No download",localH3RecTitle:"Computer",localH3ColMin:"Minimum",localH3ColValue:"Recommended",localH3HwSystem:"System",localH3HwSystemMin:"Windows or Linux",localH3HwSystemRec:"Windows or Linux. macOS cannot host it",localH3HwGpu:"GPUs",localH3HwGpuMin:"At least two NVIDIA cards, about 24GB each",localH3HwGpuRec:"Two RTX 5090s for 768p. The official reference machines use 4 to 8 data-center GPUs",localH3HwRam:"System memory",localH3HwRamMin:"About 200GB",localH3HwRamRec:"About 384GB",localH3HwDisk:"Disk",localH3HwDiskMin:"About 160GB free",localH3HwDiskRec:"More than 160GB free. The text and first/last-frame weights are about 135GB",localH3Needs:"Minimum: Windows or Linux, at least two NVIDIA GPUs around 24GB each, about 200GB of system memory, about 160GB free disk for one set, and about 300GB for both. macOS has no official CUDA path, so it cannot host this model.",localH3DownloadNote:"The helper downloads the selected weights and installs vLLM-Omni into its own folder. One set is about 135GB, and both are about 270GB. Nothing goes to the browser downloads folder.",localH3Rehearsal:"A failure does not switch sources. The download is the official BF16 weights.",localH3PrecisionInt8Hint:"Smaller and faster, and easier on GPU memory. Text and the end of a clip can be slightly weaker. Use this when memory is tight.",localH3PrecisionBf16Hint:"Closer to the official weights, and uses more GPU memory. Choose it when the card has room. Changing precision means a different weight file, not a per-video setting.",localH3SamplerHint:"res_multistep is recommended. This is the sampling algorithm, chosen at deploy time.",localH3SageHint:"Sage Attention can roughly double speed. Quality usually stays close. Unsupported GPUs fall back to the normal algorithm.",localH3SageOn:"Sage on",localH3SageOff:"Sage off",localH3Upscaler:"Also download the upscaler (about 700MB)",localH3UpscalerHint:"Optional open model, about 700MB. MiniMax H3 can use it to enlarge a clip while generating, from about 1× to 4×. It cannot enlarge videos from other models, or a clip that has already been exported. Leave it off to download H3 only.",localH3UpscalerNote:"Optional. Leave it off to download H3 only. You can add it later without downloading H3 again. China uses the domestic mirror, and international uses Hugging Face. Restart the model after adding it. Generation does not get larger on its own.",localH3UpscalerAdd:"Add the upscaler",localH3SourceScope:"This choice covers every download: weights, Python, the runtime, ffmpeg, and the upscaler when it is selected. Mainland uses China mirrors. International uses the official sites.",localH3SourceChina:"Mainland China (ModelScope)",localH3SourceWorld:"International (Hugging Face)",localH3HfToken:"Hugging Face access token",localH3HfTokenSaved:"Token saved. Enter another to replace it",localH3HfTokenRequired:"The international source needs a Hugging Face access token before download can start.",localH3ChooseDirectory:"Choose folder",localH3Download:"Start download",localH3DownloadAnyway:"Download anyway",localH3DownloadAnywayTitle:"This computer does not meet the hardware minimum",localH3DownloadAnywayText:"The minimum setup is not met. You can still download the weights (about 135GB for one set), but this computer usually cannot start the model. If free disk is too low, the download may also fail partway.",localH3DownloadAnywayOk:"Continue download",localH3Resume:"Resume",localH3Pause:"Pause",localH3Start:"Start local model",localH3RuntimeInstalling:"Installing the runtime. The helper does this itself.",localH3Starting:"The model is loading. The first start can take several minutes.",localH3Running:"The local model is running. Choose local-minimax-h3 on the canvas to generate.",localH3Stop:"Stop",lo